_rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">提升输出和循环能力，骑乘状态拓展了角色的玩法和机制。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/11/15/50494840/eba1829e50b241d33c0ea46e1ba34a19_8603243766106184298.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">被动技提升对克制敌人的全伤害；主动技可对护盾造成高额伤害并提升破盾能力，对命中敌人造成冻结积蓄值并回复一定的能量，自身破盾时，还会冻结护盾回复时间，可增加对部分回盾较快BOSS的输出利用率。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">理之律者使用时，开启必杀技将附带时停效果，大幅提高了对各类加成的利用率。非骑乘状态武器主动会附加额外倍率的伤害；骑乘状态蓄力攻击会获得额外倍率伤害，按住武器主动可补充后续伤害和动能循环。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/11/15/50494840/eba1829e50b241d33c0ea46e1ba34a19_8603243766106184298.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
